WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.197
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU MIGHT HAVE MIXED

00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:14.631
FEELINGS ABOUT MILO

00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:15.966
YIANNOPOULOS.

00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:17.434
IF YOU'RE ON THE LEFT, YOU

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:20.604
REALLY HATED HIM.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:23.673
IF YOU NEVER HATED ANYBODY FOR

00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:25.041
SOME REASON AS MUCH AS MILO

00:00:23.807 --> 00:00:26.710
YIANNOPOULOS.

00:00:25.175 --> 00:00:28.445
MILO YIANNOPOULOS CAN'T EVEN GO

00:00:26.843 --> 00:00:29.813
TO A BAR WOULDN'T GETTING DRIVEN

00:00:28.578 --> 00:00:31.948
OUT BY SCREAMING PEOPLE.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:33.116
A CROWD ASSOCIATED WITH THE

00:00:32.082 --> 00:00:35.318
DEMOCRATIC SOCIALISTS OF

00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:36.586
AMERICA, MOST OF THEM RICH KIDS,

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:39.589
GATHERED AROUND HIM TO CHANT

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.757
NAZI SCUM, GET OUT.

00:00:39.723 --> 00:00:51.067
WATCH.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:51.067
[CHANTING].

00:01:01.211 --> 00:01:04.314
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WONDER HOW MANY OF

00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:05.649
THOSE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALISTS HAVE

00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:06.282
THEIR OWN STUDENT LOANS?

00:01:05.782 --> 00:01:07.317
PROBABLY NONE.

00:01:06.416 --> 00:01:09.586
THAT'S MY GUESS.

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:12.288
THEY CLAIM THAT THE NAZI LABEL

00:01:09.719 --> 00:01:13.890
IS JUSTIFIED BY SOME OF MILO'S

00:01:12.422 --> 00:01:14.224
SUPPORTERS ONCE MADE A NAZI

00:01:14.024 --> 00:01:15.392
SALUTE.

00:01:14.357 --> 00:01:16.292
IT'S NOT CLEAR THAT MILO SAW

00:01:15.525 --> 00:01:16.660
THEM DO IT.

00:01:16.426 --> 00:01:18.528
WHATEVER.

00:01:16.793 --> 00:01:20.797
THE MOB INCLUDED AN EDITOR AT

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:24.768
THE NATION MAGAZINE CALLED

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:26.903
"ANTI-SHIELDS" AND A GIZMOTO

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:29.139
WROTER AND IN BRENDAN O'CONNOR.

00:01:27.037 --> 00:01:29.606
WE ASKED THEM TO COME ON THE

00:01:29.272 --> 00:01:30.607
SHOW.

00:01:29.739 --> 00:01:33.510
THEY SENT US THIS STATEMENT

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:36.513
WHICH THEY REPEATED ON THE

00:01:33.643 --> 00:01:37.947
PHONE, GO F YOURSELVES.

00:01:36.646 --> 00:01:39.816
WE HAVE CHAD HERE WITH US WHO

00:01:38.081 --> 00:01:40.850
WAS AT THE BAR WITH MILO.

00:01:39.949 --> 00:01:42.452
HE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:01:40.984 --> 00:01:43.620
THIS TOOK PLACE -- AM I GETTING

00:01:42.585 --> 00:01:49.459
THIS WRONG?

00:01:43.753 --> 00:01:50.827
THIS WAS A RESTAURANT CALLED

00:01:49.592 --> 00:01:51.861
CHURCHILL'S ON PARK AVENUE IN

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.431
NEW YORK.

00:01:51.995 --> 00:01:56.900
IT HAD $16 SALMON APPETIZERS AND

00:01:54.564 --> 00:01:59.269
THIS WAS THE VENUE THAT THE

00:01:57.033 --> 00:02:01.438
SOCIALISTS CHOOSE MEET AT?

00:01:59.402 --> 00:02:04.941
A RESTAURANT NAMED CHURCHILL'S?

00:02:01.571 --> 00:02:06.543
&gt;&gt; AND YOU NOTICE THE NATIONALIC

00:02:05.075 --> 00:02:08.311
FLAGS HANGING AROUND.

00:02:06.676 --> 00:02:10.680
THEY MUST HAVE COME FOR THE

00:02:08.445 --> 00:02:12.048
CRAFT BEER IS WHAT I CONCLUDED.

00:02:10.814 --> 00:02:12.716
SURELY WE THOUGHT THIS PLACE

00:02:12.182 --> 00:02:15.285
WOULD BE SAFE.

00:02:12.849 --> 00:02:16.853
WE MADE RESERVATIONS.

00:02:15.418 --> 00:02:17.554
WE JUST WANTED A SIMPLE SUNDAY

00:02:16.986 --> 00:02:19.255
ROAST.

00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:20.023
WE WERE LOOKING FORWARD TO THIS.

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:21.524
HE'S BRITISH.

00:02:20.156 --> 00:02:22.559
PROBABLY HASN'T HAD A GOOD ROAST

00:02:21.658 --> 00:02:27.330
IN A LONG TIME.

00:02:22.692 --> 00:02:28.965
WE ENCOUNTERED OF ALL THE GIN

00:02:27.464 --> 00:02:30.533
JOINTS IN THE WORLD, WE HAD TO

00:02:29.099 --> 00:02:31.334
WALK IN WHERE THE SOCIALISTS

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:32.469
WERE MEETING.

00:02:31.468 --> 00:02:33.536
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO THEY STARTED

00:02:32.602 --> 00:02:33.903
SCREAMING AT YOU AND WHAT

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.672
HAPPENED?

00:02:34.037 --> 00:02:36.005
&gt;&gt; WE STEPPED OUTSIDE FOR A

00:02:35.805 --> 00:02:38.408
MOMENT.

00:02:36.139 --> 00:02:38.775
ON THE WAY BACK IN, THEY WERE

00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:40.543
SHOUTING.

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:41.144
THEY WOULD NOT LET US GO BACK TO

00:02:40.677 --> 00:02:44.314
OUR TABLE.

00:02:41.277 --> 00:02:46.049
WE FIGURED -- WE WERE GOING TO

00:02:44.447 --> 00:02:47.951
GET OUR BAGS AND LEAVE OUT OF

00:02:46.182 --> 00:02:49.552
RESPECT FOR THE STAFF AND THE

00:02:48.084 --> 00:02:52.188
OTHER CUSTOMERS.

00:02:49.686 --> 00:02:53.523
OTHER CUSTOMERS WERE SCARED AND

00:02:52.322 --> 00:02:56.292
RUNNING OUT WITH THEIR CHILDREN.

00:02:53.656 --> 00:02:59.729
SO WHEN WE TRIED TO GO BACK TO

00:02:56.426 --> 00:03:01.965
OUR TABLE, THEY GATHERED AROUND

00:02:59.863 --> 00:03:04.467
HIM AND WOULDN'T LET US DO BACK.

00:03:02.098 --> 00:03:05.935
A VERY LARGE -- I THINK A WOMAN,

00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:06.236
LOOKED LIKE A WOMAN, SHOVED

00:03:06.069 --> 00:03:08.071
MILO.

00:03:06.369 --> 00:03:09.172
THAT'S WHEN WE REALIZED THIS WAS

00:03:08.204 --> 00:03:10.573
GOING TO GET VIOLENT.

00:03:09.305 --> 00:03:12.509
IT WAS THE TWO OF US.

00:03:10.707 --> 00:03:13.376
WE ASKED THE STAFF IF THEY WOULD

00:03:12.642 --> 00:03:16.312
RETRIEVE OUR BAGS.

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:18.014
THEY DID VERY POLITELY AND MILO

00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:19.149
JUST SAID I WAS A VERY BIG TRUMP

00:03:18.148 --> 00:03:19.916
SUPPORTER AND THAT'S WHAT THIS

00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:23.353
IS ABOUT.

00:03:20.049 --> 00:03:24.387
THE WAITRESS WAS VERY CONFUSED

00:03:23.486 --> 00:03:25.955
AND SAID OKAY.

00:03:24.521 --> 00:03:28.224
CLEARLY THE STAFF OR THE PATRONS

00:03:26.089 --> 00:03:30.059
DIDN'T KNOW WHAT WAS GOING ON OR

00:03:28.358 --> 00:03:33.196
UNDERSTOOD THIS REACTION.

00:03:30.193 --> 00:03:33.930
WE WERE TRY GUYS TRYING TO HAVE

00:03:33.329 --> 00:03:38.935
A ROAST.

00:03:34.063 --> 00:03:41.204
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID YOU KNOW THAT

00:03:39.068 --> 00:03:43.573
THAT THE MEETING WAS IN PROGRESS

00:03:41.337 --> 00:03:44.207
WHEN YOU CHOSE THIS RESTAURANT?

00:03:43.706 --> 00:03:46.743
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.744
I DIDN'T KNOW THEY KNEW WHERE

00:03:46.876 --> 00:03:48.878
PARK AVENUE WAS.

00:03:47.877 --> 00:03:50.480
THEIR PARENTS DO.

00:03:49.012 --> 00:03:51.681
BUT WE MADE RESERVATIONS SEVERAL

00:03:50.613 --> 00:03:53.683
DAYS IN ADVANCE.

00:03:51.815 --> 00:03:55.251
WE JUST WANTED A ENGLISH ROAST.

00:03:53.817 --> 00:03:55.652
THIS PLACE HAD COME VERY HIGHLY

00:03:55.385 --> 00:03:56.986
RECOMMENDED.

00:03:55.785 --> 00:03:59.289
THAT WAS THE END OF IT.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.724
I SEE ON TWITTER -- BECAUSE THE

00:03:59.422 --> 00:04:04.294
OPTICS OF THIS ARE SO TERRIBLE

00:04:01.858 --> 00:04:06.796
AND THEY KNOW HOW AWFUL THEY

00:04:04.427 --> 00:04:07.630
LOOK, ON TWITTER THEY SAID WE

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.034
PLANNED THIS.

00:04:07.764 --> 00:04:13.469
CERTIFIED SALON REPORTERS, BUT

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:14.771
CHECK MARKS SAID MILO BROUGHT

00:04:13.603 --> 00:04:16.206
HIS HUSBAND OUT THAT EVERYBODY

00:04:14.904 --> 00:04:16.940
KNOWS MILO IS MARRIED TO A BLACK

00:04:16.339 --> 00:04:19.475
GUY.

00:04:17.073 --> 00:04:20.210
I DON'T KNOW IF I'M A SEAN KING

00:04:19.609 --> 00:04:22.612
OR WHAT.

00:04:20.343 --> 00:04:24.180
BUT SO THEY KEEP TRYING TO SAY

00:04:22.745 --> 00:04:27.250
WE DID THIS ON PURPOSE.

00:04:24.314 --> 00:04:27.617
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO THIS IS BRENDAN

00:04:27.383 --> 00:04:31.621
O'CONNOR.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:32.355
HE WORKED AT GIZMOTO.

00:04:31.754 --> 00:04:35.592
THERE HE IS.

00:04:32.488 --> 00:04:41.164
HE'S OBVIOUSLY ACTING ON BEHALF

00:04:35.725 --> 00:04:42.532
OF THE GLOBAL PROLOTARIATE.

00:04:41.297 --> 00:04:44.934
THIS IS THE KID THAT WAS ON

00:04:42.665 --> 00:04:46.669
BEHALF OF THE SOCIALISTS.

00:04:45.068 --> 00:04:48.671
WE CHECKED, NEEDLESS TO SAY FROM

00:04:46.803 --> 00:04:51.474
ONE OF THE RICHEST SUBURBS OF

00:04:48.805 --> 00:04:52.609
NEW JERSEY, WENT TO A $50,000 A

00:04:51.608 --> 00:04:55.245
YEAR BOARDING SCHOOL.

00:04:52.742 --> 00:04:55.812
WAS HE THE ONE SCREAMING AT YOU?

00:04:55.378 --> 00:05:04.087
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:04:55.945 --> 00:05:06.489
HE MARCHED OUTSIDE AND ASKED

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.823
MILO ABOUT 8-MONTH-OLD NEWS

00:05:06.623 --> 00:05:08.391
STORIES.

00:05:06.956 --> 00:05:09.192
MILO WAS VERY POLITE AND HE SAID

00:05:08.524 --> 00:05:11.094
I'M HERE WITH MY FRIEND.

00:05:09.325 --> 00:05:13.296
IF YOU WANT TO INTERVIEW ME,

00:05:11.227 --> 00:05:13.997
SEND AN E-MAIL TO ME AND WE'LL

00:05:13.429 --> 00:05:14.898
SET SOMETHING UP.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:17.233
HE WOULDN'T DROP IT.

00:05:15.031 --> 00:05:17.867
HE DIDN'T KNOW WHAT HE WAS

00:05:17.367 --> 00:05:19.502
TALKING ABOUT.

00:05:19.636 --> 00:05:23.239
HE HAD NO IDEA WHAT TO ASK MILO.

00:05:21.838 --> 00:05:23.740
FINALLY MILO SAID LEAVE ME

00:05:23.373 --> 00:05:24.707
ALONE.

00:05:23.873 --> 00:05:26.209
I'M HERE WITH MY FRIEND.

00:05:24.841 --> 00:05:28.511
GET YOUR FACTS STRAIGHT.

00:05:26.342 --> 00:05:28.878
I'LL GIVE YOU A PROPER

00:05:28.645 --> 00:05:29.712
INTERVIEW.

00:05:29.012 --> 00:05:31.948
THEN WE HAVE OF COURSE THIS

00:05:29.846 --> 00:05:34.817
NATION EDITOR THAT ADMITTED ON

00:05:32.081 --> 00:05:35.652
TWITTER SHE RUNS THE NATION'S

00:05:34.951 --> 00:05:36.452
TWITTER HANDLE.

00:05:35.785 --> 00:05:38.121
SHE --

00:05:36.586 --> 00:05:38.955
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ANOTHER WORKER.

00:05:38.254 --> 00:05:40.657
&gt;&gt; ANOTHER WORKER.

00:05:39.088 --> 00:05:43.793
IT'S IMPORTANT TO KNOW, I DON'T

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:45.728
HAVE TO TELL YOU THIS, BUT THEY

00:05:43.927 --> 00:05:46.396
WERE ALL WHITE.

00:05:45.862 --> 00:05:48.798
ALL OF THEM.

00:05:46.529 --> 00:05:50.533
SO SHE'S BEEN GOING ON A STORM

00:05:48.932 --> 00:05:51.935
ON TWITTER STANDING UP FOR THE

00:05:50.667 --> 00:05:52.835
WORKING CLASS AND THE PEOPLE AND

00:05:52.068 --> 00:05:54.737
ALL OF THOSE PRECIOUS BLACK

00:05:52.969 --> 00:05:57.407
PEOPLE --

00:05:54.871 --> 00:05:58.174
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THERE WAS A TIME WHEN

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.876
SOCIALISTS CARED ABOUT ECONOMICS

00:05:58.308 --> 00:06:01.477
AND HAD A CASE TO MAKE.

00:06:00.009 --> 00:06:03.880
I DIDN'T AGREE WITH IT.

00:06:01.611 --> 00:06:05.481
BUT THEY HAD A REASONED

00:06:04.013 --> 00:06:05.882
THOUGHT-OUT CASE THAT WAS

00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:07.817
FUNDAMENTAL.

00:06:06.015 --> 00:06:09.752
RICH KIDS LIKE THIS GOT INVOLVED

00:06:07.951 --> 00:06:12.388
AND IT BAKE ALL ABOUT RACE AND

00:06:09.886 --> 00:06:14.490
GENDER LIKE EVERYTHING IS.

00:06:12.522 --> 00:06:14.857
THANKS FOR JOINING US TONIGHT,

00:06:14.624 --> 00:06:17.193
CHADWICK.

00:06:14.991 --> 00:06:19.896
WE INVITED THIS BRENDAN O'CONNOR

00:06:17.327 --> 00:06:22.532
KID ON AND WE HOPE HE WILL COME

00:06:20.029 --> 00:06:24.133
ON FROM GIZMOTO.

